tarting, operating, and growing a business. Moderated by Justin Silver, Venture Advisor and Lead, Founder Growth &amp; Venture Scaling at Tsai CITY, this student-driven conversation is an opportunity to ask candid questions and learn directly from Matt’s firsthand experience.</p><p class="">​<!-- -->Drawing from his work across real estate, home services, and other established industries, Matt will share practical lessons on navigating day-to-day operations, managing growth, making difficult decisions, and building with long-term value in mind.</p><p class="">​<strong>Come ready with questions</strong> about the challenges, choices, and tradeoffs that come with building a business, whether you’re exploring entrepreneurship or already working on something of your own.</p><p class="">​<strong>Cookies will be provided.</strong></p></div></div></div><div class="jsx-5981e6e33e2304d4 content-card"><div class="jsx-5981e6e33e2304d4 card-title flex-center gap-2 spread"><div class="jsx-5981e6e33e2304d4 title-label text-tinted fs-sm">Location</div></div><div class="jsx-5981e6e33e2304d4 content"><div class="jsx-bc498e5f7dced08b info"><div class="cursor-copy jsx-bc498e5f7dced08b"><div class="jsx-bc498e5f7dced08b fw-medium">Tsai Center for Innovative Thinking at Yale</div><div class="jsx-bc498e5f7dced08b text-tinted fs-sm mt-05">17 Prospect St, New Haven, CT 06511, USA</div></div></div><div class="jsx-bc498e5f7dced08b gmaps"><a tabindex="-1" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=41.312447899999995%2C-72.92488879999999&amp;query_place_id=ChIJkSU86LPZ54kRjvBb4_G769g" class="rounded overflow-hidden block" aria-label="View on Google Maps" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"><iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed/v1/place?center=41.312447899999995%2C-72.92488879999999&amp;key=AIzaSyDKCkbEi-ihGgegHT5k7KwIH5X5jz2zTx8&amp;q=place_id%3AChIJkSU86LPZ54kRjvBb4_G769g&amp;zoom=13" tabindex="-1" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;border:none;height:199px;display:fl