v><div class="inner"><div class="jsx-5b96bbb25927e633"><div class="jsx-5b96bbb25927e633 flex-column content"><div class="jsx-4fc9988e16909c6d message">Welcome! To join the event, please register below. </div><div class="jsx-5b96bbb25927e633 mt-1 flex-column content"><div class="jsx-5b96bbb25927e633 cta-wrapper"><div class="jsx-5b96bbb25927e633 cta flex-center gap-2 mb-1"><button class="btn lux-button flex-center medium primary solid variant-color-primary full-width no-icon" type="button"><div class="label">Register</div></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="jsx-5981e6e33e2304d4 content-card pb-1 event-about-card"><div class="jsx-5981e6e33e2304d4 card-title flex-center gap-2 spread"><div class="jsx-5981e6e33e2304d4 title-label text-tinted fs-sm">About Event</div></div><div class="jsx-5981e6e33e2304d4 content"><div class="spark-content" dir="auto"><p class="">​<!-- -->What comes after identifying the problem? In this lunch-and-learn panel, three advanced student founders will share how they approach imagining: generating possible solutions, exploring different directions, and finding creative ways to test their ideas.</p><p class="">​<!-- -->The conversation will offer a practical look at how founders move from understanding a problem to considering what they might build or try next. Participants will have the opportunity to ask questions, hear directly from peers, and learn from the approaches shaping their ventures.</p><p class="">​<!-- -->All Tsai CITY Venture Development Program participants and others interested in student founders’ work are welcome.</p><p class="">​<!-- -->This workshop is supported by Lovable. Participants will receive 100 free Lovable credits to use during the event.</p></div></div></div><div class="jsx-5981e6e33e2304d4 content-card"><div class="jsx-5981e6e33e2304d4 card-title flex-center gap-2 spread"><div class="jsx-5981e6e33e2304d4 title-label text-tinted fs-sm">Location</div></div><div class="jsx-5981e6e33e2304d4 c